#usda 1.0
(
    "USD Museum exhibit materials.textures.textures: texture networks (UsdTransform2d, a normal map, opacityThreshold) and texture files (PNG 8 and 16 bit, EXR, UDIM) under their reference prints. Built by src/build.py."
